<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.25.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 3.25.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 825,000 shares in Sokolow at 3.25 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Sokolow traded at 3.75 zlotys in a 238,891 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
